  "body_html": "<h1>wsum_mix</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem wsum_mix (α : 𝕜) (hα₀ : 0 ≤ α) (hα₁ : α ≤ 1) (x y : stdSimplex 𝕜 I) (f : I → 𝕜) : wsum (stdSimplex.mix α hα₀ hα₁ x y) f = α * wsum x f + (1 - α) * wsum y f</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>stdSimplex.mix</li>\n<li>Lottery.mix</li>\n</ul>",
